{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_13","text":"The sky?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"coree","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_14","text":"Yes!!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"coree","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_15","text":"Ark has no sky,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"coree","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_16","text":"but my mommy said there's one up on the surface.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"coree","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_17","text":"I'll be going for a surgery in 10 days, so I'd like to see the sky before then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_18","text":"What kind of surgery?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"coree","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_19","text":"I've got a rare disease, so there's this lump on my head that keeps growing bigger.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"coree","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_20","text":"My mommy is always praying to God,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"coree","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_21","text":"so I asked her what God was, and she said he could grant anything.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"coree","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_22","text":"She also says that God lives in the sky,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"coree","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_23","text":"so I want to see the sky too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1201_s_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1201_s_24",